  },
  {
   "id": "context",
   "start": 8.451,
   "end": 13.454,
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "F1",
     "text": "Most local health departments serve fewer than 50,000 people.",
     "start": 8.851,
     "end": 12.754
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "director",
   "start": 13.454,
   "end": 25.04,
   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "D1",
     "text": "Their directors are asked to prove what the community needs.",
     "start": 13.754,
     "end": 16.77
    },
    {
     "id": "D2",
     "text": "But yearly numbers show need, not where people get stuck.",
     "start": 17.17,
     "end": 20.382
    },
    {
     "id": "D3",
     "text": "So every year, the case starts over from a pile of spreadsheets.",
     "start": 20.782,
     "end": 24.24
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "promise",
   "start": 25.04,
   "end": 29.202,
   "lines": [
    {
